msgid ""
"Optionally run the daemon inside the GNOME Shell extension with a mutter-"
"backed clipboard provider (experimental)"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:57
msgid "Add a merge mode to combine several history items"
msgstr ""

